WEBVTT

00:03.520 --> 00:06.600
Yu'er come let the empress see you.

00:20.500 --> 00:24.880
One Month Later how can this be?

00:25.320 --> 00:27.560
Right how can he not follow orders?

00:27.640 --> 00:33.320
Rashly attack but he did win the battle after all Your Majesty arrives.

00:42.960 --> 00:45.160
Pay respects to Your Majesty.

00:49.680 --> 00:52.480
Let's all speak what's the matter?

00:53.720 --> 00:57.587
Your Majesty I wish to impeach Zhu Yuanzhi.

00:58.920 --> 01:04.080
Not long ago our Beishuo Army engaged in close combat with Wuzhao's Shixin division.

01:04.160 --> 01:09.520
The Ministry of War ordered General Zhu after repelling the enemy to withdraw and defend the base.

01:09.600 --> 01:14.560
But General Zhu did not follow orders privately advanced recklessly actually pursued deep into Wuzhao territory.

01:14.960 --> 01:19.920
Causing heavy losses to our troops and disrupted Your Majesty's approved battle plan.

01:20.000 --> 01:21.360
Completely.

01:22.200 --> 01:23.560
But no matter what.

01:23.720 --> 01:25.760
General Zhu achieved a great victory this time.

01:25.840 --> 01:30.840
The entire southern Pingzhou was recovered by the Beishuo Army I think not only should he not be punished.

01:30.920 --> 01:36.200
But should be heavily rewarded to encourage the enterprising spirit of all I remember.

01:36.280 --> 01:42.000
The court only gave General Zhu supplies to repel the enemy the money for his campaign.

01:42.200 --> 01:43.867
Where did it come from?

01:44.400 --> 01:48.880
This Zhu Yuanzhi is almost declaring himself king he uses.

01:50.480 --> 01:55.520
Your Majesty's land reform as a banner in Qingzhou extensively seized land.

01:55.600 --> 02:00.920
Directly distributed to the army but General Zhu did successfully implement Your Majesty's new policies.

02:01.120 --> 02:02.800
This is a great merit.

02:04.520 --> 02:09.480
Forcibly seized from great families privately divided court land this.

02:09.600 --> 02:12.400
Is clearly bandit behavior.

02:14.040 --> 02:19.200
Alright, alright stop arguing let's put this matter aside for now discuss another day.

02:19.920 --> 02:21.320
Court dismissed.

02:31.520 --> 02:36.000
This phoenix has gotten fat recently it seems.

02:36.080 --> 02:38.120
Fan Zhong's meals are quite good.

02:41.120 --> 02:43.600
Let's talk about General Zhu's matter.

02:44.720 --> 02:45.920
What do you think?

02:46.000 --> 02:51.800
Although General Zhu won a small victory he so flagrantly ignored court orders if something major happens in the future.

02:51.880 --> 02:57.880
And General Zhu still acts willfully cannot coordinate closely with the center this would be a catastrophic hole.

02:59.440 --> 03:04.840
Your son believes we cannot have wishful thinking should be punished A general in the field.

03:04.920 --> 03:10.680
May not always follow the ruler's orders the battlefield changes in an instant if everything follows central orders.

03:10.880 --> 03:12.000
Then how do we seize opportunities?

03:12.160 --> 03:17.520
Since ancient times victory and defeat are decided in an instant Father.

03:17.600 --> 03:22.560
Your son believes General Zhu's intentions are correct and he's brave and decisive should be rewarded.

03:22.640 --> 03:24.040
Xuan shall prosper.

